err←schemaFromArrow args;con;schema;out_types;res
⍝ Low-level wrapper for duckdb_schema_from_arrow
⍝ args: (connection arrow_schema_ptr out_converted_schema_ptr)
⍝ err: duckdb_error_data pointer (destroy with duckdb_destroy_error_data)

(con schema out_types)←args
res←,api.duckdb_schema_from_arrow con schema out_types
err←⊃res

